"Computers check this chat request against their native configuration and report a separate result. This does not install or approve executable code." = "Computers check this chat request against their native configuration and report a separate result. This does not install or approve executable code.";
"Controller phone link; chat access is granted separately" = "Связь с телефоном управления; доступ к чатам выдаётся отдельно";
